<title>MEXICO: Mexico not to sanction First Brands imports.</title>
<headline>Mexico not to sanction First Brands imports.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico decided not to impose trade dumping sanctions on kerosene-based gasoline additive imports from First Brands Corporation, the Trade Ministry published in the Official Gazette Thursday.</p>
<p>The ministry said the judgment was preliminary and is still reviewing the case, which arose after a complaint from Bardahl de Mexico that alleged U.S.-based First Brands was dumping its additives at prices below cost.</p>
<p>((-- Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
